#
#   style_computer_8 - CSS::StyleComputer: position-area, math-depth, the ancestor filter and
#                      the rule cache buckets
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleComputer.cpp (lines 2795-3080): compute_position_area and
#       compute_math_depth, the hashes an element contributes to the ancestor Bloom filter,
#       resetting the filter and the :has() result cache, pushing and popping ancestors, and
#       RuleCache's bucketing of rules (by id, class, tag name, pseudo-element, :root,
#       attribute) and its lookup of the buckets an element may match.
